    "Leave blank to auto-detect. Checks run every 5 seconds while the menu is open or tasks are running, and every 30 seconds when idle. Quotas use local snapshots; account quotas are requested only when you click “Sync quota”. The app never starts model requests." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leave blank to auto-detect. Checks run every 5 seconds while the menu is open or tasks are running, and every 30 seconds when idle. Quotas use local snapshots; account quotas are requested only when you click “Sync quota”. The app never starts model requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留空即可自动查找。菜单打开或有运行任务时每 5 秒检查，空闲时每 30 秒检查。额度默认读取本地快照，仅点击「联网校准」时请求账号额度。应用不会启动模型请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
